"Departments where this access group is automatically assigned to all "
"employees. When a new employee joins these departments, they automatically "
"receive this access group. This is useful for standard access rights like "
"\"All employees can access main entrance during office hours\"."
msgstr ""
"Τμήματα στα οποία αυτή η ομάδα πρόσβασης ανατίθεται αυτόματα σε όλους τους "
